cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the IJAM 2011 article below (preferred
  citation) and, where appropriate, this repository.
title: "qlPCA: reproducible notebooks for quasi-linear PCA"
abstract: >-
  Python re-implementation and chapter-by-chapter replication of the PhD thesis
  on quasi-linear PCA (qlPCA): an extension of principal components analysis to
  nonlinear relations through low-order spline transformations of continuous
  variables, fitted by alternating least squares.
type: software
authors:
